{"3719480":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Scared by Squares","steam_appid":3719480,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/150647d9d8d794a68fae26ea2a0b6a15.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie, cube-built rooms where every corner holds something unexpected. Wander through strange liminal spaces, uncover hidden dangers, solve puzzles, and face unpredictable challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/4dc4d89a4bc3350ba614dc4b6899fcdd.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/4dc4d89a4bc3350ba614dc4b6899fcdd.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/4dc4d89a4bc3350ba614dc4b6899fcdd.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/f3907c05ffe99cb34ebf7b2576abe5fd.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unsettling liminal environments filled with dreamlike sounds and an atmosphere that can turn horrifying in an instant.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/040d54125cbae951838fe191d404f8cb.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/040d54125cbae951838fe191d404f8cb.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/040d54125cbae951838fe191d404f8cb.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/f6a2991c3d65a239fb3a3e8f6928a27a.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with up to three friends in online co-op. Explore together, solve puzzles, and survive the hostile creations inside the Cube.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/c6fdc24a0a77f4387aa2ae20861dd4fe.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/c6fdc24a0a77f4387aa2ae20861dd4fe.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/c6fdc24a0a77f4387aa2ae20861dd4fe.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/090a661dc9692570327c5361358dad6d.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access includes two playable floors, each around 25–30 minutes long. Search for corrupted anomalies, remember patterns, and rebuild structures to find the way forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/cf0b23167bfb4b11244bdab35d38aa8b.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/cf0b23167bfb4b11244bdab35d38aa8b.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/cf0b23167bfb4b11244bdab35d38aa8b.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ae93b74fa702e751267e3ffa30960b2c.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only cubes are allowed. You’re sent into the Cube to cleanse the shapes that don’t belong, but roaming entities and the Cube itself will do everything they can to stop you. Focus your flashlight to cleanse the corruption.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ad8c222fe5550b59ef78a3370a6d070e.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ad8c222fe5550b59ef78a3370a6d070e.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ad8c222fe5550b59ef78a3370a6d070e.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/65064a6704987e094a1a3b9b4e8448fb.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After beating a level, compete for the best times on the leaderboards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ff94256eba8a90accbdbf9b580befc15.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ff94256eba8a90accbdbf9b580befc15.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ff94256eba8a90accbdbf9b580befc15.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST DON’T BE…<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCARED BY SQUARES.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/150647d9d8d794a68fae26ea2a0b6a15.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore eerie, cube-built rooms where every corner holds something unexpected. Wander through strange liminal spaces, uncover hidden dangers, solve puzzles, and face unpredictable challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/4dc4d89a4bc3350ba614dc4b6899fcdd.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/4dc4d89a4bc3350ba614dc4b6899fcdd.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/4dc4d89a4bc3350ba614dc4b6899fcdd.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/f3907c05ffe99cb34ebf7b2576abe5fd.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unsettling liminal environments filled with dreamlike sounds and an atmosphere that can turn horrifying in an instant.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/040d54125cbae951838fe191d404f8cb.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/040d54125cbae951838fe191d404f8cb.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/040d54125cbae951838fe191d404f8cb.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/f6a2991c3d65a239fb3a3e8f6928a27a.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with up to three friends in online co-op. Explore together, solve puzzles, and survive the hostile creations inside the Cube.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/c6fdc24a0a77f4387aa2ae20861dd4fe.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/c6fdc24a0a77f4387aa2ae20861dd4fe.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/c6fdc24a0a77f4387aa2ae20861dd4fe.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/090a661dc9692570327c5361358dad6d.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access includes two playable floors, each around 25–30 minutes long. Search for corrupted anomalies, remember patterns, and rebuild structures to find the way forward.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/cf0b23167bfb4b11244bdab35d38aa8b.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/cf0b23167bfb4b11244bdab35d38aa8b.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/cf0b23167bfb4b11244bdab35d38aa8b.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ae93b74fa702e751267e3ffa30960b2c.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only cubes are allowed. You’re sent into the Cube to cleanse the shapes that don’t belong, but roaming entities and the Cube itself will do everything they can to stop you. Focus your flashlight to cleanse the corruption.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ad8c222fe5550b59ef78a3370a6d070e.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ad8c222fe5550b59ef78a3370a6d070e.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ad8c222fe5550b59ef78a3370a6d070e.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/65064a6704987e094a1a3b9b4e8448fb.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=70 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After beating a level, compete for the best times on the leaderboards.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ff94256eba8a90accbdbf9b580befc15.poster.avif?t=1793728719\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ff94256eba8a90accbdbf9b580befc15.webm?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/extras\/ff94256eba8a90accbdbf9b580befc15.mp4?t=1793728719\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUST DON’T BE…<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCARED BY SQUARES.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Scared by Squares is an experiment in horror. Can you create fear without ghosts, zombies, creepy dolls, or the usual tropes? What if all you had was the least scary thing in the world: a simple cube? The result might surprise you.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/c47b740d8b8a5adaac0d2837509587f29f828f28\/header.jpg?t=1793728719","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/6f771645783e4d4261ac9b024adaf3adaf478487\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728719","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3719480\/6f771645783e4d4261ac9b024adaf3adaf478487\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728719","website":"https:\/\/www.scaredbysquares.com\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong>  Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel i5-4590 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 1500X or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8000 MB MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 \/ AMD Radeon R9 290 or better<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 5000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>VR Support:<\/strong> Oculus Rift and Meta Quest (via Link) with Oculus Touch controllers<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Play on a standard monitor or in VR. Standing and room-scale supported in VR. Not recommended for players sensitive to psychological horror or disorienting spaces.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong